## WpfPilot runtime discovery files live in %TEMP%\wpfpilot, never in the repo,
## so no ignore rule is needed here. (A bare 'wpfpilot/' rule would wrongly match
## the src/WpfPilot/ source directory on case-insensitive filesystems.)
